{"3504850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadvale", "steam_appid": 3504850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadvale is a free story-driven CRPG that brings the literary depth and complex morality of early 2000s classics into the modern era using physics, puzzles, and real-time combat to create a heavy and reactive world. Every decision you make leaves a scar, and maintaining your humanity is the hardest battle of all. It is a grounded, human journey that asks whether redemption can be found, or if the truth is too heavy to bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat where both brains and brawn matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive, physics-based weapons and environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive, branching dialogue system inspired by classic CRPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, narrative-driven story told through dialogue and handcrafted environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Released version to be fully voiced</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a team of volunteers</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadvale is a free story-driven CRPG that brings the literary depth and complex morality of early 2000s classics into the modern era using physics, puzzles, and real-time combat to create a heavy and reactive world. Every decision you make leaves a scar, and maintaining your humanity is the hardest battle of all. It is a grounded, human journey that asks whether redemption can be found, or if the truth is too heavy to bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat where both brains and brawn matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive, physics-based weapons and environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive, branching dialogue system inspired by classic CRPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, narrative-driven story told through dialogue and handcrafted environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Released version to be fully voiced</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a team of volunteers</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Deadvale is a free story-driven RPG combining literary depth and complex morality of 2000s classics with physics, puzzles, and action. A grounded, human journey where each decision matters and maintaining humanity is a constant battle. Can redemption can be found, or is the truth too heavy to bear?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504850/0924cfb4f22d8ec3e8be568204b0813a3f70d688/header.jpg?t=1786580190", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504850/1b3372f10a4e06859fd6977176cadedf41679df6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786580190", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504850/1b3372f10a4e06859fd6977176cadedf41679df6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786580190", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7200U @ 2.50GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Mouse &amp; keyboard recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "